/-! Product type (PART 2 of the foundation).

Model unit `foundation_prod` — moved out of `crates/clean-verify/src/spec/core_spec/foundation_types.rs`
(embed memo W1). Registered by `Specification::register_model_unit(ModelUnit::FoundationProd)`
through the same `add_inductive` / `add_recursive_def` path the literals used; the
